### Soyuz UI strings (en-US source): tui-terminal
### The terminal UI: the embedded terminal pane (Phase T5).
### Keys: <area>-<thing>, kebab-case. Keep keys identical in tr-TR/tui-terminal.ftl.

tui-terminal-hints = Esc at the prompt: files · Shift+PgUp/PgDn: scroll · Ctrl+click: link
tui-terminal-clip-allow-once = A: Allow once
tui-terminal-clip-always = S: Always for this session
tui-terminal-clip-deny = D: Deny
tui-terminal-link-copied = Link copied
